  "body": "The inputmode attribute value is missing a semicolon between \"url\" and \"numeric\".\r\nAlso, in order to be consistent with other enum value listings, the trailing semicolon should be removed.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#attributes-1\r\n> \"none\"; \"text\"; \"tel\"; \"email\"; \"url\" \"numeric\"; \"decimal\"; \"search\";\r\n\r\nThis should be:\r\n> \"none\"; \"text\"; \"tel\"; \"email\"; \"url\"; \"numeric\"; \"decimal\"; \"search\"",
